WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.190
- All right, we always
like to close out the hour

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.320
with one last, little
story to bring you joy.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.046
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:06.046 --> 00:00:08.078
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.078 --> 00:00:09.930
I can never say it enough people,

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.240
teachers are truly angels among us.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.520
I want you to meet a Washington
DC elementary school teacher

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.090
who proves my point in the sweetest way.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.440
Just before the Christmas break,

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.330
Kathleen bet her third graders,

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.850
she could make a half
court basketball shot.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.200
And if she could,

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.484
there would be a hot
chocolate party for all.

00:00:28.484 --> 00:00:30.370
So, as you can imagine,

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.170
most of the kids were
rooting hard for her,

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.750
probably not expecting her to make it.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.664
Let's see if she made it. (laughs)

00:00:35.664 --> 00:00:38.664
(children cheering)

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:44.593
(children screaming)

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:47.400
That's amazing!
(crowd claps)

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.400
She shoots, she scores.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.850
That's so amazing!
(crowd claps)

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:50.767
You know all those kids were like,

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:52.840
"She ain't ever gon' make this."

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:53.673
That's so cool.

00:00:53.673 --> 00:00:55.140
And so, the kids thought it was amazing

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:58.000
and they got a holiday
hot chocolate celebration.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.410
You can tell they were excited.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.140
We have Kathleen on the line right now,

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.370
watching on NBC4 Washington.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:06.380
So, this happened on a whim, right?

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:07.930
- It really did.

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:12.130
I've been teaching at this
school for a year and a half now.

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.680
I've never done anything like that before.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.050
I usually play basketball
with them, soccer with them.

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.420
And they know I played basketball.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:23.060
They know I played basketball in college.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.300
So, sometimes they'll ask me
to like, "Shoot this shot!"

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.270
Like, "See if you can make it."

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.540
But nothing full court, like that length.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.297
So, I saw a ball, I picked
it up and I was like,

00:01:34.297 --> 00:01:36.610
"You know what? If I make this,

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.360
let's have a hot chocolate
party on Monday."

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.980
It happened on a Friday.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:44.690
And it went in (laughs)
and they went crazy!

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:45.523
- Oh my gosh!
(crowd claps)

00:01:45.523 --> 00:01:47.360
Thank you so much Kathleen
for being an educator

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.140
and also, for just making it magical,

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.260
the whole experience magical.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:53.100
And making kids want to
show up and work hard.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.800
We love teachers like you,

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.280
especially mommas like me,
having kids that go to school.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:58.940
Thank you so much for
all that you're doing.

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:02.290
And that was one amazing
shot girl. (laughs)

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:03.960
All right.
- Thank you so much!

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.322
- Absolutely! I'm liking
your post right now.

00:02:06.322 --> 00:02:07.155
(bell dings)

00:02:07.155 --> 00:02:08.780
And that's not all. Our
season long partner,

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.300
Pilot Pen, makers of friction,

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.100
the go-to erasable pen of
The Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.140
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly,

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.120
just like you ma'am.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.000
So, they're gonna give you $1,000

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.253
just cause you're super cool.
(crowd cheers)

00:02:20.253 --> 00:02:21.093
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:21.093 --> 00:02:22.100
- Oh my God! Thank you so much!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.850
- [Kelly] That's a lot of
hot chocolate parties, ma'am.

